diff --color -ruN a/third_party/appauth/README.chromium b/third_party/appauth/README.chromium
--- a/third_party/appauth/README.chromium	1970-01-01 05:30:00.000000000 +0530
+++ b/third_party/appauth/README.chromium	2026-10-26 09:34:42.423053070 +0530
@@ -0,0 +1,21 @@
+Name: AppAuth for Android
+Short Name: appauth
+URL: https://github.com/openid/AppAuth-Android
+Version: 0.11.1
+Revision: 0.11.1
+Update Mechanism: Manual
+License: Apache-2.0
+License File: src/LICENSE
+Shipped: yes
+Security Critical: yes
+
+Description:
+The OAuth 2.0 and OpenID Connect client library for Android (net.openid.appauth),
+used by Sign in with Zynclave (chrome/android/java/src/org/chromium/chrome/
+browser/tark/zynclave). Only library/java/net/openid/appauth/** and LICENSE are
+taken from the 0.11.1 tag's archive, by android/appauth/fetch.py, which checks
+the archive against a pinned sha256.
+
+Local Modifications:
+None. The library's AndroidManifest.xml is not used: Tark's manifest declares
+the activities it needs.
